sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Admin Web UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/PostGIS
    participant Task as Background Task Queue/Worker
    participant OSRM as OSRM Routing API
    participant OR as Google OR-Tools

    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/routes/optimize {candidate_ids, vehicle_ids, objective}
    API->>DB: Validate permissions, candidate status, vehicle capacity, depot
    API-->>UI: 202 Accepted {task_id, status: QUEUED}
    API->>Task: Enqueue optimization task
    Task->>DB: Load candidate bins, mass estimates, depots, vehicle capacities
    Task->>OSRM: Request road-distance/duration matrix
    alt OSRM unavailable or matrix invalid
        Task->>DB: Mark task FAILED; persist ROUTE_FAILURE alert
    else valid matrix
        Task->>OR: Solve capacity-constrained vehicle routing problem
        alt feasible solution
            Task->>DB: Persist draft routes/stops; task SUCCEEDED
        else infeasible solution
            Task->>DB: Mark task FAILED with INFEASIBLE reason
        end
    end
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/tasks/{task_id}
    API->>DB: Read task status/progress/result reference
    API-->>UI: QUEUED/RUNNING/SUCCEEDED/FAILED + result
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/routes/{route_id}/assign
    API->>DB: Transactionally assign route + linked collection jobs
